data.address-forms#Address forms:
Autofill returns split fields that map to form inputs.
const a = await (await fetch("https://api.mapx.at/v1/autofill/suggest?q=Herrengasse%2013,%201010%20Wien&limit=3&access_token=YOUR_TOKEN")).json(); const { address_line1, postcode, place, coordinates } = a.suggestions[0]; Validation checks what the user typed:
curl -s -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN" "https://api.mapx.at/v1/address/validate?q=Haubtplatz%201,%203390%20Melk" | jq '{status, confidence, address}' status is match, corrected, ambiguous (then candidates[]) or not_found. Abbreviations, umlauts and ß are understood. Use POST with JSON for structured input.

